<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Report Ready - Wind Power System</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #2E8B57;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .logo {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #2E8B57;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
        }
        .subtitle {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }
        .message {
            background-color: #e8f5e8;
            border: 1px solid #2E8B57;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .message h3 {
            color: #2E8B57;
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        .report-info {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-left: 4px solid #2E8B57;
        }
        .info-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            padding: 5px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef;
        }
        .info-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #495057;
        }
        .info-value {
            color: #6c757d;
        }
        .actions {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #2E8B57;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 10px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .button:hover {
            background-color: #228B22;
        }
        .button-secondary {
            background-color: #6c757d;
        }
        .button-secondary:hover {
            background-color: #5a6268;
        }
        .expiration-notice {
            background-color: #fff3cd;
            border: 1px solid #ffc107;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .expiration-notice h4 {
            color: #856404;
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef;
            color: #6c757d;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #2E8B57;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <svg class="logo" viewBox="0 0 100 100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="45" fill="#2E8B57" opacity="0.2"/>
                <path d="M50 10 L60 40 L90 40 L65 60 L75 90 L50 70 L25 90 L35 60 L10 40 L40 40 Z" fill="#2E8B57"/>
                <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="8" fill="#fff"/>
            </svg>
            <h1>Wind Power System</h1>
            <div class="subtitle">Report Distribution</div>
        </div>

        <div class="message">
            <h3>✅ Your Report is Ready</h3>
            <p>Great news! Your requested report has been successfully generated and is now available for download.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="report-info">
            <h3>Report Details</h3>
            <div class="info-item">
                <span class="info-label">Report Name:</span>
                <span class="info-value">{{reportName}}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="info-item">
                <span class="info-label">Type:</span>
                <span class="info-value">{{reportType}}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="info-item">
                <span class="info-label">Description:</span>
                <span class="info-value">{{reportDescription}}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="info-item">
                <span class="info-label">Generated At:</span>
                <span class="info-value">{{generatedAt}}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="actions">
            <a href="{{downloadUrl}}" class="button">📥 Download Report</a>
            <a href="{{viewUrl}}" class="button button-secondary">👁️ View Online</a>
        </div>

        <div class="expiration-notice">
            <h4>⏰ Important: Report Expiration</h4>
            <p>This report will be available for download until <strong>{{expiresAt}}</strong>. Please download it before the expiration date to ensure you have access to the data.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated message from the Wind Power Forecasting System.</p>
            <p>© 2024 Wind Power Systems. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>
                <a href="http://windpower.com">Visit our website</a> |
                <a href="mailto:support@windpower.com">Contact Support</a> |
                <a href="http://windpower.com/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>